24\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/04e5e3644a2f85ac99f445c8feb4477d.webm?t=1659777924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/8f96f4223eec7973bb78e33c2c37bffd.webp?t=1659777924\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/3972ab4c14ff29ae527e9a0d3e4f871c.avif?t=1659777924\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Case System!</h2>Open cases with coins!<br>Yourself, Do you feel lucky? Would you like to try? You can spend the Points you earn by fighting to open a case!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/083f10dafd8cb563c357a10d56f84d34.poster.avif?t=1659777924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/083f10dafd8cb563c357a10d56f84d34.webm?t=1659777924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/083f10dafd8cb563c357a10d56f84d34.mp4?t=1659777924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/8f96f4223eec7973bb78e33c2c37bffd.webp?t=1659777924\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1523900/extras/bc18d8ba2f1815bb105480c793035a48.avif?t=1659777924\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level Editor Sandbox (Only Single Player)</li></ul>Create levels as you like. it depends on your creativity!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l